.TH mm2_seed 1 "18 February 2026" "minimap2-2.24" "Bioinformatics tools"
.SH NAME
.PP
mm2_seed \- find minimizer seed matches for minimap2 staged pipeline
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
.B mm2_seed
.RB [ -x
.IR preset ]
.RB [ -k
.IR INT ]
.RB [ -w
.IR INT ]
.RB [ options ]
.I reference.fa
.I query.fa
.B -o
.I output.json
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
.B mm2_seed
is a CLI tool that performs the seeding stage of the minimap2 mapping
pipeline. It finds minimizer seed matches between query and reference
sequences and outputs them in JSON format for downstream processing
by
.BR mm2_chain (1).
.PP
This tool is designed for debugging, algorithm analysis, and educational
purposes. For end-to-end alignment workflows, use
.BR minimap2 (1)
instead.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Preset
.TP 10
.BI -x \ STR
Preset configuration. Available presets:
.BR map-ont ,
.BR map-pb ,
.BR map-hifi ,
.BR asm5 / asm10 / asm20 ,
.BR sr ,
.BR splice .
.SS Indexing options
.TP 10
.BI -k \ INT
K-mer size [15].
.TP
.BI -w \ INT
Minimizer window size [10].
.SS Seed filtering options
.TP 10
.BI -d \ INT
SDUST threshold for masking low-complexity regions [0, disabled].
.TP
.BI -m \ INT
Max occurrence threshold. Minimizers occurring more than
.I INT
times are filtered out [auto-computed from index].
.TP
.BI -M \ INT
Hard max occurrence limit [4095].
.TP
.BI -D \ INT
Occurrence distance for selective filtering [500].
.SS Output options
.TP 10
.BI -o \ FILE
Output JSON file (required).
.TP
.B -h
Show help message.
.SH OUTPUT FORMAT
.PP
Output is a JSON file containing an array of queries, each with its
seed matches:
.PP
.nf
{
  "index_params": { "k": 15, "w": 10 },
  "queries": [{
    "name": "read1",
    "length": 1000,
    "n_seeds": 42,
    "seeds": [...]
  }]
}
.fi
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Basic seeding with ONT preset:
.PP
.RS 4
.B mm2_seed -x map-ont ref.fa reads.fq -o seeds.json
.RE
.PP
Custom k-mer and window size:
.PP
.RS 4
.B mm2_seed -k 19 -w 10 ref.fa reads.fq -o seeds.json
.RE
.PP
Full staged pipeline:
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
mm2_seed -x map-ont ref.fa reads.fq -o seeds.json
mm2_chain -x map-ont ref.fa -s seeds.json -o chains.json
mm2_align -x map-ont ref.fa reads.fq -c chains.json -o align.json
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
mm2_chain(1), mm2_align(1), minimap2(1)
